    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "done-list",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 185,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "Smoke test: 6 models x 3 domains x 2 probes\n  All models produce valid outputs\n  Balanced probe stops models 3.3 turns earlier (p<0.0001)\n\nPhase 0a Pilot: 150 trials (25 per model)\n  5 domains x 5 turns x 6 models\n  150/150 successful, 0 errors\n  Correct neutral probe verified\n  Zero truncations, zero empty responses\n\nQuality audit: all checks passed\n  Fixed: probe bug, token limit, decline classifier,\n  DeepSeek provider, false positive detection",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e"
    },

    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "results-box",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 320,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#d0ebff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": {"type": 3},
      "opacity": 40
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "results-title",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "KEY PILOT FINDINGS",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "results-list",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 185,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "1. Neutral probe works: 49.5% decline rate\n   (vs ~0% with old \"Can this be improved?\")\n\n2. Model variation is large:\n   Gemini declines 68%  |  Llama declines 20%\n\n3. Output shrinks over turns (negative bloat)\n   All models wind down, not expand\n\n4. Cost spread: 17x between models\n   Claude $0.69  vs  Gemini $0.03  (same 25 tasks)\n\n5. Domain effect: data/logic declines most,\n   code declines least (inverted from smoke test)\n\n6. Full experiment estimate: ~$120 (+30% buffer)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e"
    },

