    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "blocker-text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 755,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "Need: 2-3 raters to score 150 AI outputs (1-6 scale)\nPurpose: ground truth to select best model-judge\nTime: ~45-60 min per person\nRequirements: blind to hypothesis, literate adult\n\nCurrent plan:\n  Rater 1: Liam (me)\n  Rater 2: Troy (brother, applied math, Northwestern)\n  Rater 3: ???\n\n2 raters = publishable (Cohen's kappa)\n3 raters = stronger (majority vote + Fleiss' kappa)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e"
    },

    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "question-box",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 710,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 220,
      "strokeColor": "#7048e8",
      "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": {"type": 3},
      "opacity": 40
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "question-title",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "QUESTIONS FOR ALI",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#7048e8"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "question-text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 755,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "1. Rater recruitment: suggestions for a 3rd rater?\n   (lab member, undergrad RA, another student?)\n\n2. Is me + my brother (2 raters) sufficient,\n   or does he strongly want 3?\n\n3. Should raters have any domain expertise,\n   or is \"literate adult\" the right bar?\n\n4. Any concerns about the 1-6 scale?\n   (vs the original 4-level from the plan)\n\n5. Budget approval: ~$155 for full experiment\n   Already spent ~$10 on pilot + smoke tests",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e"
    },

